Table \ref{tab:meTurnout} shows the results here.

% turnout definitely increases post recall
% more polarized communites had a relative decrease in turnout uptick
% prior to the recall, no effect of polarization
% Recall turnout positively related to turnout
% post recall, recall turnout leads to even greater increase in turnout
% WERC membership does not matter, post-recall WERC membership small 
% increase in turnout

% These effects are net of turnout lagged and fall turnout

